      "settings": {
        "background_color": "#ffffff",
        "background_color_mobile": "#f7f2ee",
        "description": "<h2>When Blue Stone Lane grew frustrated with mass-produced ceramics that couldn't withstand their café's demands — they sought a better solution. They needed dinnerware that could balance durability with refinement—pieces that would showcase their culinary creations while standing up to daily use. At Created Co., we believe that every hospitality experience with ceramics should be a vessel that enhances experiences, both aesthetically and functionally. When Bluestone Lane, an Australian-inspired coffee and café brand with locations across major U.S. cities, approached us, they were facing a challenge that many hospitality brands encounter: finding durable, fully customized ceramics that could withstand the demands of a high-volume café environment while staying true to their brand’s identity.</h2>",
        "description_color": "#000000"
      }
    },
