        ".description br {display: block; margin-bottom: 16px; /* Adjust as needed */}"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "background_color": "#ffffff",
        "background_color_mobile": "#f7f2ee",
        "description": "<h6>Here’s how we helped: </h6><h6><strong>1. Superior Craftsmanship & Durability</strong>: Our ceramics are built to last. Fired at high temperatures for enhanced strength, they are <strong>commercial dishwasher-safe, microwave-safe, and resistant to chipping and fading</strong>, making them ideal for high-volume café use.</h6><h6><strong>2. Fully Customizable Designs</strong>: Using <strong>high-fire printing</strong>, we ensured that Bluestone Lane’s branding was seamlessly integrated into each piece, allowing them to maintain their signature aesthetic across all locations.</h6><h6><strong>3. Sustainable & Thoughtful Production</strong>: As a brand that values sustainability, Bluestone Lane aligned perfectly with our commitment to eco-friendly practices. We offer <strong>ethically made ceramics, lead-free glazes, and carbon-neutral shipping options</strong>, ensuring that their custom drinkware was both beautiful and responsible.</h6><h6><strong>4. Reliable, Scalable Supply Chain</strong>: With our <strong>streamlined ordering process and ongoing inventory management support</strong>, we provided Bluestone Lane with a reliable source for their ceramics, eliminating supply chain frustrations and allowing them to focus on growing their business.</h6>",
        "description_color": "#000000"
      }
    },
