        "background_color_mobile": "#f7f2ee",
        "description": "<h6> The results?</h6><ul><li><h6><strong>Significant Cost Savings</strong>: With fewer replacements needed, they reduced their overall spend on drinkware.</h6></li><li><h6><strong>Stronger Brand Identity</strong>: Their custom-designed ceramics reinforced brand recognition and created a cohesive customer experience across all locations.</h6></li><li><h6><strong>Consistency & Reliability</strong>: They now have a dependable, long-term supplier that understands their needs and can scale with them as they grow.</h6></li></ul>",
